      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>Destination delivery handover for automobiles and cars is a critical process that ensures the vehicle is in the expected condition at the time of delivery. This procedure typically involves several key steps to verify the vehicle's status and to maintain transparency between the parties involved.</p>

<h3>1. Daylight Condition Re-Inspection</h3>
<p>To ensure that the vehicle is free from any damages or discrepancies, a thorough re-inspection is conducted under daylight conditions. This allows for a clear and comprehensive assessment of the vehicle's exterior and interior. The following aspects are evaluated:</p>
