<h3>2. Odometer Verification</h3>
<p>Another critical aspect of the handover process is the verification of the odometer reading against the LR bilty (Logistics Receipt). This step ensures that the vehicle has not exceeded the mileage stated at the time of pickup. Key points include:</p>
