    <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Legal Protection:</strong> Providing a record that can be referred to in case of disputes.</span></li>
</ul>
<p>By adhering to these steps, the delivery process not only ensures the buyer's satisfaction but also maintains the integrity of the delivery service.</p></div>
